-s-curve-and-its-derivative-why-the-peak-arrives-early)853 0 R(the-self-defeating-loop-expensive-picks-bankrupt-the-miners)865 0 R(trigger-based-rotation-design)887 0 R(two-kinds-of-constraints-self-resolving-versus-self-intensifying)856 0 R(what-survives)883 0 R(why-memory-and-why-second)874 0 R(why-timing-is-unknowable)885 0 R]>>>>>>
